{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"agent_message","text":"REJECT\n\n### VERIFICATION EVIDENCE\n\n- `uv run pytest -q tests/test_lalal.py tests/test_separation.py`: 31 passed.\n- `git diff --check origin/main...HEAD`: passed.\n- Code review: `_run_operation` commits every returned side to its final path, including already-valid paired vocal output.\n\n### VERDICT REASON\n\nThe recovery path violates the required paired-output durability rule. If one `vocals-original` artifact is missing/corrupt but its paired artifact remains valid, `LalalSeparator.split()` downloads both `stem` and `back`, and `_run_operation` overwrites both final artifacts. Preserve the valid paired artifact and only replace/recheckpoint the missing/corrupt side during deliberate paid recovery; add a regression test proving the valid paired file’s hash/content is unchanged."}}
